    {
     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: checking a news story",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "看到关于「采访、回答与理解新闻」的消息，你会先核实什么？",
       "alumno": "When you read a news story about «interviewing, answering and understanding news», what would you check first?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我想先听听不同人的看法。",
       "alumno": "First I want to hear different people's views.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果大家的意见不一样呢？",
       "alumno": "What if people's opinions are different?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我们可以把理由写下来，再一起讨论。",
       "alumno": "We can write down the reasons and discuss them together.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: checking a news story",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "关于「采访、回答与理解新闻」的消息传播很快，但传播速度不等于准确。",
       "alumno": "News about «interviewing, answering and understanding news» can spread quickly, but speed doesn't mean accuracy.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "判断消息是否可靠时，应核实原始来源，并比较独立报道。",
       "alumno": "To judge whether a report is reliable, check the original source and compare independent coverage.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较几种办法时，可以先说明各自的优点和不足。",
       "alumno": "When comparing several options, you can first explain their advantages and disadvantages.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
